  "id": "hypofrontality",
  "term": "hypofrontality",
  "definition": "Hypofrontality is reduced or abnormal frontal brain activity described as a possible result of disrupted cortical excitation–inhibition balance. In schizophrenia spectrum disorders, it is linked with problems in basic information processing that may contribute to cognitive impairment.",
